    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d567">

                <pb facs="0632" n="528" sameAs="frus:frus1932v03/pg528"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/4598: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Consul General at Shanghai (Cunningham)</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1932-03-07T12:00:00-05:00">March 7, 1932—12 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>80. For the Minister. Your March 6, 1 a.m.</p>
                <p>See Department’s 76, March 4, 11 p.m., paragraphs 1 and 4.</p>
                <p>What common action taken? What report, if any, made by the <pb facs="0633"
                        n="529" xml:id="pg529"/> military representatives of the League powers to
                    the League and/or to their respective governments?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
